    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Messy data cleaner: standardise names, phones and addresses with AI\nPaste messy contact rows into a sheet. The AI returns a cleaned name, email check, phone in international format and tidy company name.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "94854839-ce91-56ea-9d6e-80b743f179b7",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Contacts** and these headers in row 1 (see `sheet-headers.csv`).\n2. Fill the input columns (raw_name). Leave clean_name, clean_phone, clean_company empty: the AI fills it.\n3. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and how many rows to process per run.\n4. Connect Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n5. Run once by hand, check the results, then switch to **Active**. It only touches rows where clean_name is empty.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "ecf14733-d29b-5a72-8e18-d0fcc74a0b8c",
